#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"How to use a virtual private endpoint to privately connect to IBM Quantum "
"Platform."
msgstr ""
"Cara menggunakan titik akhir peribadi maya untuk menyambung secara peribadi "
"ke IBM Quantum Platform."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use virtual private endpoints for VPC to privately connect to IBM Quantum "
"Platform"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan titik akhir peribadi maya untuk VPC bagi menyambung secara peribadi "
"ke IBM Quantum Platform"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore FDQN */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore FDQN */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use virtual private endpoints for VPC to privately connect to IBM Quantum "
"Platform {#use-virtual-private-endpoints-for-vpc-to-privately-connect-to-"
"ibm-quantum-platform}"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan titik akhir peribadi maya untuk VPC bagi menyambung secara peribadi "
"ke IBM Quantum Platform {#use-virtual-private-endpoints-for-vpc-to-"
"privately-connect-to-ibm-quantum-platform}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use Virtual Private Endpoints (VPE) for VPC to connect to IBM Quantum&reg; "
"from your VPC network by using IP address that you specify, allocated from a"
" subnet within your VPC.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan Titik Akhir Peribadi Maya (VPE) untuk VPC bagi menyambung ke IBM "
"Quantum&reg; dari rangkaian VPC anda menggunakan alamat IP yang anda "
"tentukan, diperuntukkan daripada subnet dalam VPC anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"VPEs are virtual IP interfaces that are bound to an endpoint gateway created"
" on a per-service basis. The endpoint gateway is a virtualized function that"
" scales horizontally, is redundant and highly available, and spans all "
"availability zones of your VPC. Endpoint gateways enable communications from"
" virtual server instances within your VPC and IBM Cloud&reg; service on the "
"private backbone. VPE for VPC lets you control all private addressing within"
" your cloud. For more information, see [About virtual private endpoint "
"gateways](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-about-vpe).\n"
msgstr ""
"VPE ialah antara muka IP maya yang terikat kepada get laluan titik akhir "
"yang dicipta bagi setiap perkhidmatan. Get laluan titik akhir adalah fungsi "
"yang divirtualkan yang skala secara mendatar, berlebihan dan sangat "
"tersedia, serta merentangi semua zon ketersediaan VPC anda. Get laluan titik"
" akhir membolehkan komunikasi daripada contoh pelayan maya dalam VPC anda "
"dan perkhidmatan IBM Cloud&reg; pada tulang belakang peribadi. VPE untuk VPC"
" membolehkan anda mengawal semua pengalamatan peribadi dalam awan anda. "
"Untuk maklumat lanjut, lihat [Tentang get laluan titik akhir peribadi "
"maya](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-about-vpe).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Within IBM Quantum Platform, all customer data is transmitted over the "
"private network regardless of whether it is accessed through a public "
"endpoint or VPE.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam IBM Quantum Platform, semua data pelanggan dihantar melalui rangkaian "
"peribadi tanpa mengira sama ada ia diakses melalui titik akhir awam atau "
"VPE.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Connecting to IBM Quantum Platform through the public endpoints transmits "
"all request and response data over the public internet. To connect to IBM "
"Quantum Platform by using a VPE, you must use the IBM Quantum Platform API "
"or SDK. IBM Quantum Platform can only be accessed through the public "
"network.\n"
msgstr ""
"Menyambung ke IBM Quantum Platform melalui titik akhir awam menghantar semua"
" data permintaan dan respons melalui internet awam. Untuk menyambung ke IBM "
"Quantum Platform menggunakan VPE, anda mesti menggunakan IBM Quantum "
"Platform API atau SDK. IBM Quantum Platform hanya boleh diakses melalui "
"rangkaian awam.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Sebelum anda mulakan {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before you target a VPE for IBM Quantum Platform, complete the following "
"steps:\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebelum menyasarkan VPE untuk IBM Quantum Platform, lengkapkan langkah-"
"langkah berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Create a Virtual Private Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"getting-started).\n"
msgstr ""
"[Cipta Virtual Private Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"getting-started).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Plan for the network topology](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"planning-considerations) to connect to VPEs.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Rancang topologi rangkaian](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"planning-considerations) untuk menyambung ke VPE.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Set access controls](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-configure-"
"acls-sgs-endpoint-gateways) for your VPE.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Tetapkan kawalan akses](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-configure-"
"acls-sgs-endpoint-gateways) untuk VPE anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Understand the [limitations](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"limitations-vpe) of having a VPE.\n"
msgstr ""
"Fahami [had](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-limitations-vpe) "
"mempunyai VPE.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Understand how to [view VPE "
"details](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpe-viewing-details-of-an-"
"endpoint-gateway).\n"
msgstr ""
"Fahami cara [melihat butiran VPE](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"vpe-viewing-details-of-an-endpoint-gateway).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up a VPE for IBM Quantum Platform {#set-up-a-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-"
"platform}"
msgstr ""
"Sediakan VPE untuk IBM Quantum Platform {#set-up-a-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-"
"platform}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There are several ways to create a VPE gateway. If you use the "
"[CLI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpc-"
"reference&interface=cli#vpe-clis) or "
"[API](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/vpc/latest#create-endpoint-gateway), you"
" must specify the [Cloud Resource Name "
"(CRN)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-crn) of the region "
"in which you want connect to IBM Quantum Platform. Review the following "
"table for the available regions and CRNs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Terdapat beberapa cara untuk mencipta get laluan VPE. Jika anda menggunakan "
"[CLI](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpc-"
"reference&interface=cli#vpe-clis) atau "
"[API](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/vpc/latest#create-endpoint-gateway), "
"anda mesti menentukan [Nama Sumber Awan "
"(CRN)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-crn) rantau di mana "
"anda ingin menyambung ke IBM Quantum Platform. Semak jadual berikut untuk "
"rantau dan CRN yang tersedia.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Region | Plans   | Fully Qualified Domain Name (FDQN) | Cloud Resource Name (CRN) |\n"
"|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|\n"
"| `us-east` | `Standard` | `private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:us-east:::endpoint:private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"
"| `eu-de` | `Standard` | `private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:eu-de:::endpoint:private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Rantau | Pelan   | Nama Domain Yang Berkelayakan Penuh (FDQN) | Nama Sumber Awan (CRN) |\n"
"|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|-----------------|\n"
"| `us-east` | `Standard` | `private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:us-east:::endpoint:private.us-east.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"
"| `eu-de` | `Standard` | `private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` | `crn:v1:bluemix:public:quantum-computing:eu-de:::endpoint:private.eu-de.quantum.cloud.ibm.com` |\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Configuring an endpoint gateway {#configuring-an-endpoint-gateway}"
msgstr "Konfigurasi get laluan titik akhir {#configuring-an-endpoint-gateway}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "To configure a VPE gateway, follow these steps:\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengkonfigurasi get laluan VPE, ikuti langkah-langkah berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"List the available services, including IBM Cloud infrastructure services "
"available (by default) for all VPC users.\n"
msgstr ""
"Senaraikan perkhidmatan yang tersedia, termasuk perkhidmatan infrastruktur "
"IBM Cloud yang tersedia (secara lalai) untuk semua pengguna VPC.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Create an endpoint gateway](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"ordering-endpoint-gateway) for IBM Quantum Platform that you want to be "
"privately available to the VPC.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Cipta get laluan titik akhir](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"ordering-endpoint-gateway) untuk IBM Quantum Platform yang anda mahu "
"tersedia secara peribadi kepada VPC.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Bind a reserved IP address](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-bind-"
"unbind-reserved-ip) to the endpoint gateway.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Ikat alamat IP tempahan](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-bind-"
"unbind-reserved-ip) ke get laluan titik akhir.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[View the created VPE gateways](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-"
"vpe-viewing-details-of-an-endpoint-gateway) associated with IBM Quantum "
"Platform.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Lihat get laluan VPE yang "
"dicipta](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/vpc?topic=vpc-vpe-viewing-details-of-an-"
"endpoint-gateway) yang dikaitkan dengan IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now your virtual server instances in the VPC can access your IBM Quantum "
"Platform instance privately.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kini contoh pelayan maya anda dalam VPC boleh mengakses contoh IBM Quantum "
"Platform anda secara peribadi.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use your VPE for IBM Quantum Platform {#use-your-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-"
"platform}"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan VPE anda untuk IBM Quantum Platform {#use-your-vpe-for-ibm-quantum-"
"platform}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After you create an endpoint gateway for IBM Quantum Platform, follow these "
"steps:\n"
msgstr ""
"Selepas anda mencipta get laluan titik akhir untuk IBM Quantum Platform, "
"ikuti langkah-langkah berikut:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the VPE with `qiskit-ibm-runtime` (Python SDK) {#use-the-vpe-with-"
"qiskit-ibm-runtime-python-sdk}"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan VPE dengan `qiskit-ibm-runtime` (Python SDK) {#use-the-vpe-with-"
"qiskit-ibm-runtime-python-sdk}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"VPE support requires `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.24.0 or later.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Sokongan VPE memerlukan `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.24.0 atau lebih baharu.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When instantiating `QiskitRuntimeService`, specify "
"`private_endpoint=True`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Apabila memulakan `QiskitRuntimeService`, tentukan "
"`private_endpoint=True`.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the VPE with the IBM Quantum API {#use-the-vpe-with-the-ibm-quantum-api}"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan VPE dengan IBM Quantum API {#use-the-vpe-with-the-ibm-quantum-api}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After creating an endpoint gateway for IBM Quantum Platform, use the service"
" endpoint's FQDN for the target region.\n"
msgstr ""
"Selepas mencipta get laluan titik akhir untuk IBM Quantum Platform, gunakan "
"FQDN titik akhir perkhidmatan untuk rantau sasaran.\n"
